MARIAN ILUSTRADO Voicebank
================================================================================

This project supports the MARIAN ILUSTRADO voicebank for training acoustic
fly targets. MARIAN ILUSTRADO is an English ARPAsing UTAU voicebank.

Author: Kanabun
Download: https://downloadmarian.carrd.co/
ARPAsing Directory: https://arpasing.tubs.wtf/en/directories/voicebanks

