FlyWire / Hemibrain Connectome Data
================================================================================

The MORE FLY module supports optional integration with FlyWire and Hemibrain
connectome data for biologically-faithful PN→KC wiring.

FlyWire:
- Dorkenwald et al. (2024). Neuronal wiring diagram of an adult brain
- https://flywire.ai/

Hemibrain:
- Scheffer et al. (2020). A connectome and analysis of the adult Drosophila 
  central brain. eLife 2020;9:e57443
- https://neuprint.janelia.org/

